    <string>calmera uses the microphone when you log a meal by voice.</string>
    <key>NSPhotoLibraryAddUsageDescription</key>
    <string>Allow calmera to save captured photos to your photo library.</string>
    <key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
    <string>Allow calmera to access your photo library to load/import meal photos.</string>
    <key>NSSpeechRecognitionUsageDescription</key>
    <string>calmera turns what you say into text on this iPhone to log your meal. Your recording isn’t saved or sent anywhere.</string>
